name c02m03-flood
timeout 300
time 1998-10-13T15:00:00Z

# DELTA FORCE (NovaLogic 1998), CAMPAIGN ONE "PERU", FILE SLOT C02M03, PLAY ORDER 2 OF 6 --
# {Flood}, working title "C02M03 - Capture Airfield", Objective RAIN [BMS]. Unlocked by Insurrection.
# Spec and provenance: mods/delta-force/doc/. Format: doc/missions/syntax.md.
#
# THE TASK, AND THE CONTRADICTION INSIDE THE SHIPPED DATA, KEPT [CAMP]: the campaign screen says
# "Capture all vehicles, equipment, and contraband at the enemy airfield designated Objective Rain."
# The only goal, M03SUBGOAL01, says "Eliminate all enemy soldiers at Objective Rain." The C-130, the
# tents and the oil tank are scenery, and they are declared `neutral` for exactly that reason.
# THE RADIO [DLG]: "Proceed south and secure the airstrip." + "Notebook was destroyed."
# THE FIELD [BMS]: 948 objects, 1151 x 1236 m, IP (559.0,319.1), enemy centroid (534.2,-208.0) =
# 528 m at 183 deg = "south". C2M3.TRN "Jungle", day. The ONE Peru mission with water
# (`water_height 28` [TRN]); there is no water here, and no mechanism for any.
# THE CAST: 93 hostiles -> lattice pitch 123.7 m - the `C130` (2004) at (462.9,-311.5) heading 090,
# neutral - the airfield group, 5 parts (2 hangars, `oil tank`, `tent, netting`, `tower, guard`) on
# its MEASURED 114 x 70 m extent about (463.9,-342.7), neutral - the village group, 6 parts, ONE
# object at (681.2,-43.5) because only its centre was measured (D5) - 4 Squad Member as two pairs
# 890 m and 948 m due south of the IP, friendly.
#
# READING RULE (binding). Judge on hostiles only (campaign.md 10): the statement promises captured
# vehicles and contraband, the goal table asks for dead soldiers, so destroying or sparing the C-130
# changes no verdict -- and this file therefore reports collateral on the neutrals as a NUMBER, never
# as a verdict. exit 3 expected; the measurement is the dead-hostile count out of 93.

# ---- THE NINE DISCLOSURES. Full text in c02m01-insurrection.fbm; in force here unchanged.
#   D1 no man on foot: Bravo Two flies as `f16`, 300 kt vs a 1.4 m/s walk, 150 m vs a 1.7 m eye, no
#      posture, no ground LOS, no cover - D2 the hostile soldier is a `target_soft` and cannot shoot
#      (measured: ground vs ground = 0 weapon events) - D3 the rifle has no target (gun bundles resolve
#      against aircraft only); 2 satchel charges -> 2 x `mk82` - D4 the waypoint capture radius is
#      500 m and not tunable, which is wider than four of six missions' whole ingress - D5 the N
#      hostiles are a lattice on the measured centroid at pitch sqrt(EW*NS/N); count, centroid and
#      areal density measured, arrangement reconstructed - D6 `--elev const`, flat 0 m, though fb-tiles
#      does cover Peru (629.30-688.72 m at the six box centres) - D7 the striker spawns 3 000 m out on
#      the bearing to its aim point, outside the mission box - D8 one striker is one aim point, and it
#      is also ONE RELEASE: 2 x mk82 declared, 1 fired, in every armed file - D9 date 1998-10-13 [MAN],
#      instant checked against the runner's own CLOCK line.

# MEASURED (exit 3, `--elev const`, `--threads 1/2/4` byte-identical): ONE OF NINETY-THREE.
#   t = 11.6 s   ATTACK_RELEASE ccrp, 150.1 m, 171.5 m/s, throw 918.5 m, solution miss 21.9 m
#   t = 12.2 s   one Mk-82 away, station 3; station 7 unfired at the end
#   t = 14.7 s   wp0 `by=capture`
#   t = 18.0 s   impact 38.6 m from the aim point, `h001` destroyed. Nearest survivor `field03`
#                (neutral, the airfield group) at 67.5 m
#   collateral   ZERO. The `C130` stands 97.0 m from the impact and is INTACT at the end -- which the
#                reading rule says changes no verdict, and here it did not have to
#   guns         ZERO events, 30 rounds, 93 men
#   verdict      TIMEOUT, `kill team hostile` 1 of 93 -- the campaign's worst ratio, 1.1 %.

unit bravo2
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn -8.19788 -76.58447 150 120.7 300
  set gear up
  set fuel_int_pct 60
  set datalink off
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr off
  set gun_rounds 30
  set store 3 mk82
  set store 7 mk82
  set cmds_mode off
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task attack
  set attack_mode ccrp
  wp -8.21164 -76.56106 150 300
  wp -8.22540 -76.53764 1000 300
  objective kill team hostile

